flowchart LR
  subgraph Device[User device — observed]
    User([User]) --> Editor[Browser editor]
    Editor --> Renderer[Local Mermaid renderer]
    Renderer --> Preview[SVG preview]
    Preview --> Export[PNG export]
  end

  Export --> Download[(Local download)]
  Renderer -->|Parse failure| Error[Inline syntax error]
  Error --> Editor

  Publish{Publish externally?}
  Download -. user-approved action .-> Publish
  Publish -.->|Not part of local export| Remote[(Remote platform)]
